(7288176, 1136146, 6519, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous photo, absolutely stunning. And yet, if you showed it to 100 people and asked each one to give you FIVE keywords describing it, I believe you wouldn''t get a single "concrete" amongst those 500 words.<br/> <br/>Still an awesome image, though  :-) Will have to carefully think about the score for a bit first.</td>', 'That is a gorgeous photo, absolutely stunning. And yet, if you showed it to 100 people and asked each one to give you FIVE keywords describing it, I believe you wouldn''t get a single "concrete" amongst those 500 words. Still an awesome image, though  :-) Will have to carefully think about the score for a bit first.', '2014-11-28 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288194, 1135814, 163430, '<td valign="top">Technically, this should be asphalt, but who cares. Stunning image nevertheless.</td>', 'Technically, this should be asphalt, but who cares. Stunning image nevertheless.', '2014-11-28 08:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
