(7288246, 1136148, 30490, '<td valign="top">The positives for this image - nice colors and definitely on topic.  The negatives - so much of the image is out of focus, and such a tiny part is in focus that it honestly makes me dizzy to look at this image.  I don''t mind artistic blurring, but they shouldn''t give me vertigo!</td>', 'The positives for this image - nice colors and definitely on topic.  The negatives - so much of the image is out of focus, and such a tiny part is in focus that it honestly makes me dizzy to look at this image.  I don''t mind artistic blurring, but they shouldn''t give me vertigo!', '2014-11-28 13:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288247, 1136176, 30490, '<td valign="top">Is this the best that you could do for this topic?  The bright lights are a distraction and while it looks like there is a pile of concrete behind the fence, I can''t really tell.  Then it is just about trucks sitting on concrete.  Not a good composition.  Keep trying though.</td>', 'Is this the best that you could do for this topic?  The bright lights are a distraction and while it looks like there is a pile of concrete behind the fence, I can''t really tell.  Then it is just about trucks sitting on concrete.  Not a good composition.  Keep trying though.', '2014-11-28 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288248, 1136017, 30490, '<td valign="top">Ok, abstract and concrete, so it meets the challenge.  Just not very interesting to me.</td>', 'Ok, abstract and concrete, so it meets the challenge.  Just not very interesting to me.', '2014-11-28 13:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288249, 1136015, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on the horizon, but the image is so grainy it is hard to see exactly what is concrete in this shot.  I don''t care for whatever filter or texture you have applied.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'I like the colors on the horizon, but the image is so grainy it is hard to see exactly what is concrete in this shot.  I don''t care for whatever filter or texture you have applied.  Better luck next time.', '2014-11-28 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288250, 1136191, 30490, '<td valign="top">Ok you are on topic.  A good black and white image, just not quite as compelling as others in this challenge.</td>', 'Ok you are on topic.  A good black and white image, just not quite as compelling as others in this challenge.', '2014-11-28 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288251, 1136163, 30490, '<td valign="top">On topic but not compelling</td>', 'On topic but not compelling', '2014-11-28 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288253, 1136158, 30490, '<td valign="top">A weird perspective.  It doesn''t really compel me to figure out what it is... Only a 5 from me.</td>', 'A weird perspective.  It doesn''t really compel me to figure out what it is... Only a 5 from me.', '2014-11-28 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288254, 1136165, 30490, '<td valign="top">Another abstract unrecognizable concrete image.  Not very compelling. A 5 from me.</td>', 'Another abstract unrecognizable concrete image.  Not very compelling. A 5 from me.', '2014-11-28 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288255, 1135869, 30490, '<td valign="top">This could be better if you had focused on one of the "frames" and had a bit more detail in the wall.  It is just too dark to really appreciate that it is concrete and the scenes beyond the wall are too blurry to make them interesting either.  A good effort, keep trying.</td>', 'This could be better if you had focused on one of the "frames" and had a bit more detail in the wall.  It is just too dark to really appreciate that it is concrete and the scenes beyond the wall are too blurry to make them interesting either.  A good effort, keep trying.', '2014-11-28 13:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288256, 1136111, 30490, '<td valign="top">Meh, not very compelling this image.  Yes you are on topic, but just not grabbing my attention.</td>', 'Meh, not very compelling this image.  Yes you are on topic, but just not grabbing my attention.', '2014-11-28 13:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288257, 1136140, 30490, '<td valign="top">I think you were trying to capture the interesting shading and staining of the concrete as well as the plants growing within it.  A closer cropping might have improved this image and if you had focused on either then color variations or the plant life I think the result would have been stronger.</td>', 'I think you were trying to capture the interesting shading and staining of the concrete as well as the plants growing within it.  A closer cropping might have improved this image and if you had focused on either then color variations or the plant life I think the result would have been stronger.', '2014-11-28 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288258, 1136196, 30490, '<td valign="top">On topic, interesting "movement" with the blurring, just not very compelling on the artistic scale.</td>', 'On topic, interesting "movement" with the blurring, just not very compelling on the artistic scale.', '2014-11-28 14:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
