(7288607, 1136146, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the lightning strike.  I love this image, but not sure that it is really about concrete.  Yes, I realize that there is plenty of the stuff in the image, but the main subject is really lightning.  That being said, I still think this is an excellent image and kudos to you for being out in the storm.  An 8 from me.</td>', 'Nice capture of the lightning strike.  I love this image, but not sure that it is really about concrete.  Yes, I realize that there is plenty of the stuff in the image, but the main subject is really lightning.  That being said, I still think this is an excellent image and kudos to you for being out in the storm.  An 8 from me.', '2014-11-30 16:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288609, 1136129, 30490, '<td valign="top">Plain, simple and effective!  Nice use of color and great texture in the concrete.</td>', 'Plain, simple and effective!  Nice use of color and great texture in the concrete.', '2014-11-30 16:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288610, 1136132, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of being on a journey evoked by this image.  Good job!</td>', 'I like the sense of being on a journey evoked by this image.  Good job!', '2014-11-30 16:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288611, 1136161, 30490, '<td valign="top">Like this one a lot.  Great color with the bark, and spot on for the topic. Bumping to a 7</td>', 'Like this one a lot.  Great color with the bark, and spot on for the topic. Bumping to a 7', '2014-11-30 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288612, 1135855, 30490, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, but I really like this image.  Cats are so fun to watch as they explore the world.  Judging by the flowers blooming you must be in the southern hemisphere.  Great colors and a very charming puddy cat!</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, but I really like this image.  Cats are so fun to watch as they explore the world.  Judging by the flowers blooming you must be in the southern hemisphere.  Great colors and a very charming puddy cat!', '2014-11-30 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288613, 1136120, 30490, '<td valign="top">Wow, busy architecture!  You did a great job capturing all the different squares in this building.</td>', 'Wow, busy architecture!  You did a great job capturing all the different squares in this building.', '2014-11-30 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288844, 1136146, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2014-12-01 13:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288963, 1136146, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if others seem to think this is more about the lighting than the concrete, because I do!<br/> <br/>Still nevertheless a good image, but not for this challenge.</td>', 'I''m wondering if others seem to think this is more about the lighting than the concrete, because I do! Still nevertheless a good image, but not for this challenge.', '2014-12-01 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288986, 1135836, 177322, '<td valign="top">Photos of men working - working hard at an honest living have always intrigued me.  I don''t think we see enough of that genre - it is, I suppose, a version of photojournalism - and you have captured it well here.  I applaud your choice to convert to B&amp;W.  My concern is that folks who have not actually participated in a large pour will appreciate what you have here. If it were up to me - you would ribbon.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Photos of men working - working hard at an honest living have always intrigued me.  I don''t think we see enough of that genre - it is, I suppose, a version of photojournalism - and you have captured it well here.  I applaud your choice to convert to B&W.  My concern is that folks who have not actually participated in a large pour will appreciate what you have here. If it were up to me - you would ribbon.  Best of luck.', '2014-12-01 22:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288987, 1136149, 177322, '<td valign="top">Concrete is so ugly but this image is lovely: its rough, gray and gritty texture is softened and rendered quite attractive by the interlacing vines of various hues.  Great eye; even better capture.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Concrete is so ugly but this image is lovely: its rough, gray and gritty texture is softened and rendered quite attractive by the interlacing vines of various hues.  Great eye; even better capture.  Best of luck.', '2014-12-01 23:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289023, 1135876, 178836, '<td valign="top">fancy</td>', 'fancy', '2014-12-02 07:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289029, 1135814, 101668, '<td valign="top">Concrete? Lovely picture and I''m voting as such (8) just in case I''m wrong. But I do think its actually DNMC.</td>', 'Concrete? Lovely picture and I''m voting as such (8) just in case I''m wrong. But I do think its actually DNMC.', '2014-12-02 08:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289034, 1135865, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great textures. The stones stand vigilantly, under stormy and dramatic sky as a bonus. well done.</td>', 'Great textures. The stones stand vigilantly, under stormy and dramatic sky as a bonus. well done.', '2014-12-02 09:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289035, 1136150, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great light in this shot, contrasts very well with the sharp detail and texture of the foreground.</td>', 'Great light in this shot, contrasts very well with the sharp detail and texture of the foreground.', '2014-12-02 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289036, 1136156, 12611, '<td valign="top">My type of shot for sure. so nicely keyed up- and the blown out sky passage works beautifully- and it can only be that way- Sometimes the only way out is through...</td>', 'My type of shot for sure. so nicely keyed up- and the blown out sky passage works beautifully- and it can only be that way- Sometimes the only way out is through...', '2014-12-02 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289037, 1135997, 12611, '<td valign="top">Perfectly detailed and interesting- yet I can;t decide whether I am a bigger fan of what you did not show, or did not present, or whether I would have liked to see more more and a big square detailed crop. I will have to give you the benefit of the doubt, and view it a few more times on later occasions!</td>', 'Perfectly detailed and interesting- yet I can;t decide whether I am a bigger fan of what you did not show, or did not present, or whether I would have liked to see more more and a big square detailed crop. I will have to give you the benefit of the doubt, and view it a few more times on later occasions!', '2014-12-02 09:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289038, 1136149, 12611, '<td valign="top">Where flora meets concrete is always a lovely nexus- and this is no exception.</td>', 'Where flora meets concrete is always a lovely nexus- and this is no exception.', '2014-12-02 09:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289039, 1136174, 12611, '<td valign="top">really nicely presented- with jags of light, dark corners and a foreboding\blurry foreground, Almost a Matisse out-the-window beach painting gone Noir on film.</td>', 'really nicely presented- with jags of light, dark corners and a foreboding\blurry foreground, Almost a Matisse out-the-window beach painting gone Noir on film.', '2014-12-02 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289040, 1135854, 12611, '<td valign="top">Assuming this is an FDNY shot, nice slice.</td>', 'Assuming this is an FDNY shot, nice slice.', '2014-12-02 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289041, 1135841, 12611, '<td valign="top">Love the color and light, the perspective is nice- but my untrained eye wants to see it square without the top 3rd overhang.</td>', 'Love the color and light, the perspective is nice- but my untrained eye wants to see it square without the top 3rd overhang.', '2014-12-02 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289042, 1136120, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail. Nice to get lost in a shot like this.</td>', 'Beautiful detail. Nice to get lost in a shot like this.', '2014-12-02 09:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289043, 1136000, 12611, '<td valign="top">you''ve depicted how concrete can have vibrance in its decay, and how very slow and beautiful that decay can be...</td>', 'you''ve depicted how concrete can have vibrance in its decay, and how very slow and beautiful that decay can be...', '2014-12-02 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289045, 1136165, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The world swirls and vibrates around the incredibly still...</td>', 'Very nice. The world swirls and vibrates around the incredibly still...', '2014-12-02 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289047, 1136190, 12611, '<td valign="top">Superb night shot.</td>', 'Superb night shot.', '2014-12-02 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289048, 1135985, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great find and presentation.</td>', 'Great find and presentation.', '2014-12-02 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289049, 1136191, 12611, '<td valign="top">fantastic find. a fairy-tale hieroglyph.</td>', 'fantastic find. a fairy-tale hieroglyph.', '2014-12-02 09:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289050, 1136048, 12611, '<td valign="top">Futuristic and gritty. well done.</td>', 'Futuristic and gritty. well done.', '2014-12-02 09:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
