(7289052, 1136111, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, you dehumanize the scene, only to re-direct and shift perspective to the future, a new concrete ecosystem.</td>', 'Great perspective, you dehumanize the scene, only to re-direct and shift perspective to the future, a new concrete ecosystem.', '2014-12-02 09:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289053, 1136153, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colors. very well presented.</td>', 'Great detail and colors. very well presented.', '2014-12-02 09:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289055, 1135978, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blur and warm colors. The shallow depth does belie the size as well.</td>', 'Beautiful blur and warm colors. The shallow depth does belie the size as well.', '2014-12-02 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289056, 1136147, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and presentation.</td>', 'Nice angle and presentation.', '2014-12-02 09:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289057, 1136122, 12611, '<td valign="top">Impressive textural contrast.</td>', 'Impressive textural contrast.', '2014-12-02 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289192, 1135865, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shapes and grey scale, shadow and light.</td>', 'Interesting use of shapes and grey scale, shadow and light.', '2014-12-02 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289194, 1136147, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  Great composition and love the scattering of color in the leaves and the coats and even the lines on the boat.  Makes me want to jump on a plane to Paris to experience it for myself!  Great job - 8<br/> <br/>After another look at all of the images, I''m bumping to a 9.  One of my favorite images in this challenge</td>', 'Love this one.  Great composition and love the scattering of color in the leaves and the coats and even the lines on the boat.  Makes me want to jump on a plane to Paris to experience it for myself!  Great job - 8 After another look at all of the images, I''m bumping to a 9.  One of my favorite images in this challenge', '2014-12-02 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
