(7289699, 1135866, 163430, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth.<br/>It is obvious by the shape of the laps that a very narrow aperture was used. Did you have any diffraction issues? Did you try focus stacking to get it even deeper?</td>', 'Excellent depth.It is obvious by the shape of the laps that a very narrow aperture was used. Did you have any diffraction issues? Did you try focus stacking to get it even deeper?', '2014-12-03 18:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
