(7289952, 1136127, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool architecture, and nicely composed. A bit grainy in the sky and it appears to have been broad daylight, so I''m a little confused by that...</td>', 'Very cool architecture, and nicely composed. A bit grainy in the sky and it appears to have been broad daylight, so I''m a little confused by that...', '2014-12-04 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
