(7289970, 1135834, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good contrast between sharp and detail-filled concrete and soft flowing water. The ice is a very nice addition as well.</td>', 'Nice. Good contrast between sharp and detail-filled concrete and soft flowing water. The ice is a very nice addition as well.', '2014-12-04 22:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
