(7290125, 1136196, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m bummed. I had this as one of my higher choices and was all set to mention it in the "<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1240811" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Top 20</a>" thread, but then I read your comment: <i><u>"I just wanted to see what happens when I put a trash photo on the line."</u></i>.  To think I picked a "trash" photo would take away from the other ones I''ve highlighted.  Maybe they''re "trash" too ... don''t know.<br/> <br/>I know this challenge was well, a challenge; to find an interesting subject, etc...  I recognized the Lensbaby use immediately and guess I got a warm fuzzy just because of that.  LOL.<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Glad to know you had fun nonetheless.  Take care.</td>', 'I''m bummed. I had this as one of my higher choices and was all set to mention it in the "Top 20" thread, but then I read your comment: "I just wanted to see what happens when I put a trash photo on the line.".  To think I picked a "trash" photo would take away from the other ones I''ve highlighted.  Maybe they''re "trash" too ... don''t know. I know this challenge was well, a challenge; to find an interesting subject, etc...  I recognized the Lensbaby use immediately and guess I got a warm fuzzy just because of that.  LOL. Anyway.  Glad to know you had fun nonetheless.  Take care.', '2014-12-05 11:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
