(7290289, 1136196, 61552, '<td valign="top">I gotta admit, between me and my brother, he''s the artistic right-brained, and I''m the technical left-brained.  But that just increases my appreciation for those with artistic talent.  Sometimes, I can do quite well mimicking an idea I find online.  Coming up with the idea myself is my first and maybe biggest challenge.  My humor then gets in the way.<br/></td>', 'I gotta admit, between me and my brother, he''s the artistic right-brained, and I''m the technical left-brained.  But that just increases my appreciation for those with artistic talent.  Sometimes, I can do quite well mimicking an idea I find online.  Coming up with the idea myself is my first and maybe biggest challenge.  My humor then gets in the way.', '2014-12-05 22:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7290291, 1135814, 136989, '<td valign="top"><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asphalt" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Asphalt</a> is a component used to create <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asphalt_concrete" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Asphalt Concrete</a>. FWIW - I don''t think it''s a translation mistake at all. :)</td>', 'Asphalt is a component used to create Asphalt Concrete. FWIW - I don''t think it''s a translation mistake at all. :)', '2014-12-05 23:16:58.000000', NULL, 0),
