(7290369, 1136153, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PapaBob:</b></div><hr/><i> Love the perspective!<br/> <br/>Wish I could have seen the run down the stairs, if you were seen I am betting people were wondering what the heck you were doing, anyway it made me chuckle just thinking about it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hehe. There were quite a few people that saw me running the stairs. I took the shot before I started work and only had about 10 minutes to do it. A lot of the evening shift (I work in a big hospital) was arriving and walking through the stairwell.  I got to my office drenched in sweat.  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by PapaBob: Love the perspective! Wish I could have seen the run down the stairs, if you were seen I am betting people were wondering what the heck you were doing, anyway it made me chuckle just thinking about it.   Hehe. There were quite a few people that saw me running the stairs. I took the shot before I started work and only had about 10 minutes to do it. A lot of the evening shift (I work in a big hospital) was arriving and walking through the stairwell.  I got to my office drenched in sweat.  :)', '2014-12-06 16:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
